    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many have wandered into the mysterious forest unlocked by the blue key, never to return? What secrets linger on the overgrown paths, and what fate awaits those who enter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the forest with nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight to guide you. The path ahead is lined with remnants of those who ventured before, their stories etched into the environment. Navigate the eerie woods, evade unseen threats, and uncover the truth behind the key and the forest. Will you find your way out, or will you join the lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/0b0b97d4f93e76e4390e81e531b8d81c.avif?t=1755268808\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the first episode,</strong> '<i>Forgotten Steps</i>,' you step into the shoes of a\u00a0Class-D Personnel forced into the into the eerie forest of SCP-860. Navigate the shadowy woods, uncover unsettling remnants of those who came before, and evade the lurking predator that calls this place home. Future episodes will delve into new chilling SCP stories, expanding your journey into the mysterious and terrifying SCP universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.poster.avif?t=1755268808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.webm?t=1755268808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.mp4?t=1755268808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Atmospheric Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 A slow-burn horror experience focused on exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Immersive Horror</strong> \u2013 No combat, only survival. The horror builds through sound, visuals, and the fear of what lurks just beyond your sight.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Use found objects and clues to progress through the forest, abandoned structures, and blocked pathways.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Episodic SCP Horror</strong> \u2013 Future episodes will introduce new SCP-inspired stories, expanding the mysteries beyond the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out, or will you become just another lost soul in the endless woods?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many have wandered into the mysterious forest unlocked by the blue key, never to return? What secrets linger on the overgrown paths, and what fate awaits those who enter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the forest with nothing but your wits and a flickering flashlight to guide you. The path ahead is lined with remnants of those who ventured before, their stories etched into the environment. Navigate the eerie woods, evade unseen threats, and uncover the truth behind the key and the forest. Will you find your way out, or will you join the lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/0b0b97d4f93e76e4390e81e531b8d81c.avif?t=1755268808\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the first episode,</strong> '<i>Forgotten Steps</i>,' you step into the shoes of a\u00a0Class-D Personnel forced into the into the eerie forest of SCP-860. Navigate the shadowy woods, uncover unsettling remnants of those who came before, and evade the lurking predator that calls this place home. Future episodes will delve into new chilling SCP stories, expanding your journey into the mysterious and terrifying SCP universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.poster.avif?t=1755268808\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.webm?t=1755268808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456960/extras/3aa9e6ed75aa41d87a820bb5bc8b4101.mp4?t=1755268808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Atmospheric Horror Experience</strong> \u2013 A slow-burn horror experience focused on exploration, tension, and environmental storytelling.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Immersive Horror</strong> \u2013 No combat, only survival. The horror builds through sound, visuals, and the fear of what lurks just beyond your sight.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Environmental Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Use found objects and clues to progress through the forest, abandoned structures, and blocked pathways.<br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Episodic SCP Horror</strong> \u2013 Future episodes will introduce new SCP-inspired stories, expanding the mysteries beyond the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it out, or will you become just another lost soul in the endless woods?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Inspired by SCP-860, take on the role of a lone Class-D Personnel forced into the mysterious forest behind the blue key. Follow the treacherous path, uncovering remnants of those who came before. With no turning back, your only choice is to push forward.",
